# The home list names every page with where it stands now, and each page
# opens from its row and comes back to the list. About says how a computer
# finds this reader. An update check with no network says so in words, and
# its banner offers Join Wi-Fi, which opens the Wi-Fi page. The channel and
# the automatic updates are runtime controls on a screen of their own, and
# changing the channel still asks first.
# At the largest text size the list runs to a second page, so the route
# turns to rows it cannot see and turns back for the ones it left behind.
wait-for Settings
expect Connections
expect Bluetooth
expect Wi-Fi
expect On · Not connected
expect Device
expect Battery
expect 72% · Discharging
expect-missing Checking…
shot settings-home
# The simulator offers Settings no Bluetooth backend, which a reader whose
# runtime cannot drive the radio also sees: a sentence, not a dead switch.
tap Bluetooth
wait-for This version of Cobalt cannot use Bluetooth on this reader.
expect-missing Turn on to find devices
shot settings-bluetooth-unsupported
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Connections
tap-paged Battery
wait-for Charge
expect 72%
expect Status
expect Discharging
expect-missing Reading the battery.
shot settings-battery
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Settings
tap-paged Model and versions
wait-for From your computer
expect This reader
expect Simulated Kobo Clara BW
expect For support
expect 1072 × 1448 pixels
expect kobo setup
expect-missing SIMULATOR:
expect-missing Reading this reader's details.
shot settings-about
# About turns a page rather than run off the panel where its facts do not
# fit; the simulator's reader has few enough that one page holds them.
maybe-tap-id more
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Settings
maybe-tap-id previous
wait-for Connections
tap-paged Software update
wait-for Check for updates
expect Installed
expect Nothing is downloaded until you choose to install it.
expect Channel and automatic updates
expect Stable · Cobalt and apps update on their own
shot settings-update
tap Channel and automatic updates
wait-for Update Cobalt automatically
expect Update apps automatically
expect change back here at any time
expect-missing state, and secrets
shot settings-update-options
tap-id channel-beta
wait-for Confirm update channel
tap Cancel
wait-for Update Cobalt automatically
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Check for updates
scenario offline
tap Check for updates
wait-for This reader is not on Wi-Fi.
expect-missing this reader is not on a network
expect Check again
shot settings-update-offline
tap Join Wi-Fi
wait-for Not connected
shot settings-wifi
# Back from the Wi-Fi page the check opened returns to the check, and back
# from there is the home list.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for This reader is not on Wi-Fi.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Settings
expect-missing Join Wi-Fi
